                {
                    "id": "engineering",
                    "topic": "engineering",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "驱动事件与运行账本解耦，CodeBuddy以独立驱动映射permission参数并区分credits/USD报告，stderr保留尾部并有配置探测；slash命令只是发followup让父Agent调用工具，不保证已开始执行。首次事件、最终事件和退出码的区别值得保留而非用单状态掩盖。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-07-github-1425006726-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1425006726:root",
                            "area": "code",
                            "fingerprint": "679dd4fb7838fcb473c8b368e20aa24a43af99aa"
                        }
                    ],
                    "reviewed_at": "2026-10-21T08:00:58.928Z",
                    "status": "current"
                },
                {
                    "id": "contribution",
                    "topic": "technical_innovation",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "相比在多个终端搬运任务，插件统一委派句柄、驱动事件与父侧状态，并把外部模型链嵌入DSH。DRIVERS/sink分离减少生命周期重复；外部CLI能力与宿主子代理helper归上游，后端数量和“免费”preset名称都不证明质量或低成本。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-07-github-1425006726-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1425006726:root",
                            "area": "code",
                            "fingerprint": "679dd4fb7838fcb473c8b368e20aa24a43af99aa"
                        }
                    ],
                    "reviewed_at": "2026-10-21T08:00:58.928Z",
                    "status": "current"
                },
                {
                    "id": "critical_question",
                    "topic": "limitations",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "归一的completed是否可靠？OpenCode/Pi的usesResultEvent=false使exit0且无timeout即可完成，error事件仅记账；首JSON后直接await handle.result，allowedWaitSeconds不是全程硬截止。POSIX取消仅杀直接子进程，末尾无换行stdout没有flush。默认bypass_permissions并自动失败换模型时，任务副作用可能重复。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-07-github-1425006726-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1425006726:root",
                            "area": "code",
                            "fingerprint": "679dd4fb7838fcb473c8b368e20aa24a43af99aa"
                        }
                    ],
                    "reviewed_at": "2026-10-21T08:00:58.928Z",
                    "status": "current"
                },
                {
                    "id": "innovation_hypothesis",
                    "topic": "technical_innovation",
                    "basis": "unverified",
                    "text": "给各驱动定义终态错误契约和产物断言，将绝对截止传播至Run，可能减少exit0误成功与有心跳无限等。固定样例覆盖error后exit0、无换行终帧、持续心跳无结果与正常交付，比较误成功率及取消残留；若统一契约误判合法协议，则返回驱动特有状态而非强装统一完成。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-07-github-1425006726-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1425006726:root",
